(   zero:) Tj
T*
(   int_{-pi}^pi sin\(mx\) * cos\(nx\) dx = 0 for all integers m, n.) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   The trigonometric set is mutually orthogonal on [-pi, pi].) Tj
