(   = pi^2 / 3 - 4 * [ \(cos x\)/1^2 - \(cos 2x\)/2^2 + \(cos 3x\)/3^2 - \(cos 4x\)/4^2 + ... ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 5: Deduce Series \(i\) - Euler's Basel Problem:) Tj
T*
(   Set x = pi \(point of continuity where f\(pi\) = pi^2\):) Tj
T*
(   cos\(n*pi\) = \(-1\)^n.) Tj
T*
(   pi^2 = pi^2 / 3 + 4 * sum_{n=1}^infinity [ \(-1\)^n * \(-1\)^n / n^2 ] = pi^2 / 3 + 4 *) Tj
T*
(   sum_{n=1}^infinity 1 / n^2) Tj
T*
(   pi^2 - pi^2 / 3 = 4 * sum_{n=1}^infinity 1 / n^2) Tj
T*
(   \(2/3\)*pi^2 = 4 * sum_{n=1}^infinity 1 / n^2) Tj
T*
(   => sum_{n=1}^infinity 1 / n^2 = \(2/3\)*pi^2 / 4 = pi^2 / 6. \(Part i proved\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 6: Deduce Series \(ii\):) Tj
T*
(   Set x = 0 \(point of continuity where f\(0\) = 0\):) Tj
T*
(   0 = pi^2 / 3 + 4 * sum_{n=1}^infinity [ \(-1\)^n / n^2 ]) Tj
T*
(   - pi^2 / 3 = - 4 * sum_{n=1}^infinity [ \(-1\)^\(n+1\) / n^2 ]) Tj
T*
(   => sum_{n=1}^infinity \(-1\)^\(n+1\) / n^2 = pi^2 / 12. \(Part ii proved\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 7: Deduce Series \(iii\) \(Sum of Odd Reciprocals\):) Tj
T*
(   Add series \(i\) and \(ii\):) Tj
T*
(   2 * sum_{k=1}^infinity 1 / \(2k - 1\)^2 = pi^2 / 6 + pi^2 / 12 = 3*pi^2 / 12 = pi^2 / 4) Tj
T*
(   => sum_{k=1}^infinity 1 / \(2k - 1\)^2 = pi^2 / 8. \(Part iii proved\).) Tj
