/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Find the Fourier series of f\(x\) = x + x^2 on the interval [-pi, pi]. Hence evaluate the sum: sum_{n=1}^infinity 1/n^2.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Decompose f\(x\) into Odd and Even Parts:) Tj
T*
(   f\(x\) = \(x\) + \(x^2\), where g\(x\) = x is odd and h\(x\) = x^2 is even.) Tj
T*
(   By linearity of Fourier series:) Tj
T*
(   - Fourier series of x provides the sine terms \(bn\).) Tj
T*
(   - Fourier series of x^2 provides the constant \(a0\) and cosine terms \(an\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Read out coefficients from Subjectives 6 and 7:) Tj
T*
(   - From Subjective 7:) Tj
T*
(   a0 = 2*pi^2 / 3 => a0 / 2 = pi^2 / 3.) Tj
T*
(   an = 4 * \(-1\)^n / n^2.) Tj
T*
(   - From Subjective 6:) Tj
T*
(   bn = 2 * \(-1\)^\(n + 1\) / n.) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Assemble the Combined Fourier Series:) Tj
T*
(   f\(x\) = pi^2 / 3 + sum_{n=1}^infinity [ 4 * \(-1\)^n / n^2 ] * cos\(nx\) + sum_{n=1}^infinity [ 2 *) Tj
T*
(   \(-1\)^\(n+1\) / n ] * sin\(nx\).) Tj
T*
(   Expanded form:) Tj
T*
(   x + x^2 = pi^2 / 3 - 4 * [ \(cos x\)/1^2 - \(cos 2x\)/2^2 + \(cos 3x\)/3^2 - ... ]) Tj
T*
(   + 2 * [ sin x - \(sin 2x\)/2 + \(sin 3x\)/3 - ... ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Deduction at Endpoints x = pi:) Tj
T*
(   - By Dirichlet's theorem, at x = pi \(point of jump discontinuity of periodic extension\):) Tj
T*
(   S\(pi\) = \(1/2\) * [ f\(pi-\) + f\(-pi+\) ].) Tj
T*
(   f\(pi-\) = pi + pi^2.) Tj
T*
(   f\(-pi+\) = -pi + \(-pi\)^2 = -pi + pi^2.) Tj
T*
(   S\(pi\) = \(1/2\) * [ \(pi + pi^2\) + \(-pi + pi^2\) ] = \(1/2\) * \(2*pi^2\) = pi^2.) Tj
T*
(   - In the Fourier series, set x = pi:) Tj
T*
(   cos\(n*pi\) = \(-1\)^n, sin\(n*pi\) = 0.) Tj
T*
(   pi^2 = pi^2 / 3 + sum_{n=1}^infinity [ 4 * \(-1\)^n / n^2 ] * \(-1\)^n) Tj
T*
(   pi^2 = pi^2 / 3 + 4 * sum_{n=1}^infinity 1 / n^2) Tj
T*
(   \(2/3\)*pi^2 = 4 * sum_{n=1}^infinity 1 / n^2) Tj
T*
(   => sum_{n=1}^infinity 1 / n^2 = pi^2 / 6.) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   The Fourier series is established and sum 1/n^2 = pi^2/6 is confirmed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
