(   = - \(2 / n^2\) * [ 1 + \(-1\)^n ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Values for Even and Odd n:) Tj
T*
(   - If n is odd: 1 + \(-1\)^n = 0 => an = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - If n is even \(n = 2m\): 1 + \(-1\)^n = 2 => an = -4 / n^2 = -4 / \(2m\)^2 = -1 / m^2.) Tj
