BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Obtain the Half-Range Cosine Series for f\(x\) = sin\(x\) on the interval [0, pi]. \(This represents full-wave rectification in electrical/biomedical engineering\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Compute a0:) Tj
T*
(   a0 = \(2 / pi\) * int_0^pi sin x dx = \(2 / pi\) * [ -cos x ]_0^pi) Tj
T*
(   = \(2 / pi\) * [ -\(-1\) - \(-1\) ] = \(2 / pi\) * \(2\) = 4 / pi.) Tj
T*
(   Constant term: a0 / 2 = 2 / pi.) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Compute an:) Tj
T*
(   an = \(2 / pi\) * int_0^pi sin x * cos\(nx\) dx.) Tj
T*
(   Use identity: 2 * sin A * cos B = sin\(A + B\) + sin\(A - B\):) Tj
T*
(   an = \(1 / pi\) * int_0^pi [ sin\(\(1 + n\)x\) + sin\(\(1 - n\)x\) ] dx.) Tj
T*
(   - For n = 1:) Tj
T*
(   a1 = \(1 / pi\) * int_0^pi sin\(2x\) dx = \(1 / pi\) * [ -cos 2x / 2 ]_0^pi = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - For n >= 2:) Tj
T*
(   an = \(1 / pi\) * [ -cos\(\(n + 1\)x\) / \(n + 1\) + cos\(\(n - 1\)x\) / \(n - 1\) ]_0^pi.) Tj
T*
(   At x = pi: cos\(\(n+1\)pi\) = \(-1\)^\(n+1\) = -\(-1\)^n, and cos\(\(n-1\)pi\) = -\(-1\)^n.) Tj
T*
(   Term at pi = -\(-\(-1\)^n\)/\(n+1\) + \(-\(-1\)^n\)/\(n-1\) = \(-1\)^n / \(n+1\) - \(-1\)^n / \(n-1\)) Tj
T*
(   = \(-1\)^n * [ 1/\(n+1\) - 1/\(n-1\) ] = \(-1\)^n * [ -2 / \(n^2 - 1\) ].) Tj
T*
(   Term at 0 = -1/\(n+1\) + 1/\(n-1\) = [ - \(n-1\) + \(n+1\) ] / \(n^2 - 1\) = 2 / \(n^2 - 1\).) Tj
T*
(   Difference = [ -2*\(-1\)^n / \(n^2 - 1\) ] - [ 2 / \(n^2 - 1\) ] = - [ 2 / \(n^2 - 1\) ] * [ 1 + \(-1\)^n) Tj
T*
(   ].) Tj
T*
(   an = \(1 / pi\) * [ - 2 / \(n^2 - 1\) ] * [ 1 + \(-1\)^n ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Evaluate an for Even and Odd n:) Tj
T*
(   - If n is odd: 1 + \(-1\)^n = 0 => an = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - If n is even \(n = 2m\): 1 + \(-1\)^n = 2 => an = -4 / [ pi * \(4m^2 - 1\) ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Assemble the Fourier Cosine Series:) Tj
T*
(   sin x = 2 / pi - \(4 / pi\) * sum_{m=1}^infinity [ cos\(2mx\) / \(4m^2 - 1\) ]) Tj
T*
(   = 2 / pi - \(4 / pi\) * [ \(cos 2x\)/\(1*3\) + \(cos 4x\)/\(3*5\) + \(cos 6x\)/\(5*7\) + ... ].) Tj
T*
ET

endstream
