(   Step 5: Deduction at x = 0:) Tj
T*
(   0 = 2 / pi - \(4 / pi\) * [ 1/\(1*3\) + 1/\(3*5\) + 1/\(5*7\) + ... ]) Tj
T*
(   => 1/\(1*3\) + 1/\(3*5\) + 1/\(5*7\) + ... = \(2 / pi\) * \(pi / 4\) = 1/2.) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   The full-wave rectification Fourier series is established, and the sum of telescopic fractions) Tj
T*
(   evaluates to 1/2.) Tj
