T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Fourier Series of f\(x\) = x on [-pi, pi]:) Tj
T*
(   From Subjective 6:) Tj
T*
(   a0 = 0, an = 0 for all n >= 1.) Tj
T*
(   bn = 2 * \(-1\)^\(n + 1\) / n.) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Parseval's Identity for [-pi, pi]:) Tj
T*
(   \(1 / pi\) * int_{-pi}^pi [f\(x\)]^2 dx = a0^2 / 2 + sum_{n=1}^infinity \(an^2 + bn^2\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Evaluate Left-Hand Side:) Tj
