(   [Problem Statement]: Apply Parseval's Identity to the half-range sine series of f\(x\) = 1 on [0, pi] to evaluate: sum_{n=1}^infinity 1 / \(2n - 1\)^2.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Half-Range Sine Series of f\(x\) = 1 on [0, pi]:) Tj
T*
(   bn = \(2 / pi\) * int_0^pi 1 * sin\(nx\) dx = \(2 / \(n*pi\)\) * [ 1 - \(-1\)^n ].) Tj
T*
(   - bn = 0 for even n.) Tj
T*
(   - bn = 4 / \(n * pi\) for odd n \(n = 2k - 1\).) Tj
T*
