(   Step 2: Parseval's Identity for Half-Range Sine Series on [0, pi]:) Tj
T*
(   \(2 / pi\) * int_0^pi [f\(x\)]^2 dx = sum_{k=1}^infinity bn^2.) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Evaluate Left-Hand Side:) Tj
T*
(   [f\(x\)]^2 = 1^2 = 1.) Tj
T*
(   int_0^pi 1 dx = pi.) Tj
T*
(   LHS = \(2 / pi\) * pi = 2.) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Evaluate Right-Hand Side:) Tj
T*
(   bn^2 = [ 4 / \(\(2k - 1\)*pi\) ]^2 = 16 / [ pi^2 * \(2k - 1\)^2 ].) Tj
T*
(   RHS = sum_{k=1}^infinity [ 16 / \(pi^2 * \(2k - 1\)^2\) ] = \(16 / pi^2\) * sum_{k=1}^infinity 1 /) Tj
T*
