T*
(   2 = \(16 / pi^2\) * sum_{k=1}^infinity 1 / \(2k - 1\)^2.) Tj
T*
(   Multiply by pi^2 / 16:) Tj
T*
(   sum_{k=1}^infinity 1 / \(2k - 1\)^2 = 2 * \(pi^2 / 16\) = pi^2 / 8.) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   1/1^2 + 1/3^2 + 1/5^2 + ... = pi^2 / 8.) Tj
