/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Find the Complex Fourier Series of f\(x\) = e^\(a*x\) on [-pi, pi] \(where a is a non-zero real constant\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Compute Complex Fourier Coefficients cn:) Tj
T*
(   cn = \(1 / \(2*pi\)\) * int_{-pi}^pi e^\(ax\) * e^\(-i*nx\) dx) Tj
T*
(   = \(1 / \(2*pi\)\) * int_{-pi}^pi e^\(\(a - i*n\)*x\) dx.) Tj
T*
ET

