(   Step 2: Evaluate the Integral:) Tj
T*
(   cn = \(1 / \(2*pi\)\) * [ e^\(\(a - i*n\)*x\) / \(a - i*n\) ]_{-pi}^pi) Tj
T*
(   = [ 1 / \(2*pi * \(a - i*n\)\) ] * [ e^\(\(a - i*n\)*pi\) - e^\(-\(a - i*n\)*pi\) ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Simplify Exponentials:) Tj
T*
(   e^\(\(a - i*n\)*pi\) = e^\(a*pi\) * e^\(-i*n*pi\) = e^\(a*pi\) * \(-1\)^n.) Tj
T*
(   e^\(-\(a - i*n\)*pi\) = e^\(-a*pi\) * e^\(i*n*pi\) = e^\(-a*pi\) * \(-1\)^n.) Tj
T*
(   Difference = \(-1\)^n * [ e^\(a*pi\) - e^\(-a*pi\) ] = \(-1\)^n * 2 * sinh\(a*pi\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Substitute back into cn:) Tj
T*
(   cn = [ 1 / \(2*pi * \(a - i*n\)\) ] * [ \(-1\)^n * 2 * sinh\(a*pi\) ]) Tj
T*
(   = [ sinh\(a*pi\) / pi ] * [ \(-1\)^n / \(a - i*n\) ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 5: Rationalize the Denominator:) Tj
T*
(   1 / \(a - i*n\) = \(a + i*n\) / \(a^2 + n^2\).) Tj
T*
(   cn = [ sinh\(a*pi\) / pi ] * \(-1\)^n * [ \(a + i*n\) / \(a^2 + n^2\) ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 6: Assemble the Complex Fourier Series:) Tj
T*
(   e^\(ax\) = [ sinh\(a*pi\) / pi ] * sum_{n=-infinity}^infinity [ \(-1\)^n * \(a + i*n\) / \(a^2 + n^2\) ]) Tj
T*
(   * e^\(i*nx\).) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   The complex Fourier series of e^\(ax\) is established.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
