BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Explain Practical Harmonic Analysis. Derive formulas for computing the Fourier coefficients a0, an, and bn from a set of 2m discrete equidistant experimental data points.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Concept of Practical Harmonic Analysis:) Tj
T*
(   - In biomedical and engineering applications, functions are often not known in analytical form,) Tj
T*
(   but rather as discrete sampled data pairs \(x_k, y_k\) measured at equidistant intervals over one) Tj
T*
(   period T = 2*pi.) Tj
T*
(   - Harmonic analysis approximates the continuous Fourier integrals using numerical quadrature) Tj
T*
(   \(composite trapezoidal rule\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Derivation of Discrete Formulas:) Tj
T*
(   - Let the period 2*pi be divided into N = 2m equal subintervals of width Delta_x = 2*pi / N.) Tj
T*
(   - Data points: x_k = k * \(2*pi / N\) with measured values y_k for k = 0, 1, ..., N - 1.) Tj
T*
(   - Constant term a0:) Tj
T*
(   a0 = \(1 / pi\) * int_0^\(2pi\) y dx ~ \(1 / pi\) * sum_{k=0}^{N-1} y_k * \(2*pi / N\)) Tj
T*
(   = \(2 / N\) * sum_{k=0}^{N-1} y_k = 2 * \(Mean of y\).) Tj
T*
(   Therefore: a0 / 2 = Mean of y.) Tj
T*
(   - Cosine coefficients an:) Tj
T*
(   an = \(1 / pi\) * int_0^\(2pi\) y * cos\(nx\) dx ~ \(1 / pi\) * sum_{k=0}^{N-1} y_k * cos\(n*x_k\) *) Tj
T*
(   \(2*pi / N\)) Tj
T*
(   = \(2 / N\) * sum_{k=0}^{N-1} y_k * cos\(n*x_k\) = 2 * Mean of \(y * cos nx\).) Tj
T*
(   - Sine coefficients bn:) Tj
T*
(   bn = \(1 / pi\) * int_0^\(2pi\) y * sin\(nx\) dx ~ \(2 / N\) * sum_{k=0}^{N-1} y_k * sin\(n*x_k\)) Tj
T*
(   = 2 * Mean of \(y * sin nx\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Summary of Computational Rules:) Tj
T*
(   - a0 = 2 * \(Average of y values\).) Tj
T*
(   - a1 = 2 * \(Average of y * cos x values\).) Tj
T*
(   - b1 = 2 * \(Average of y * sin x values\).) Tj
T*
(   - a2 = 2 * \(Average of y * cos 2x values\).) Tj
T*
(   - b2 = 2 * \(Average of y * sin 2x values\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
