(   = \(2 / T\) * [ int_0^\(T/2\) V0 * cos\(n*omega0*t\) dt - int_{T/2}^T V0 * cos\(n*omega0*t\) dt ]) Tj
T*
(   = \(2*V0 / \(n*omega0*T\)\) * [ sin\(n*omega0*t\) ]_0^\(T/2\) - \(2*V0 / \(n*omega0*T\)\) * [) Tj
T*
(   sin\(n*omega0*t\) ]_{T/2}^T.) Tj
T*
(   Since omega0*T = 2*pi, n*omega0*T/2 = n*pi, and sin\(n*pi\) = sin\(0\) = sin\(2n*pi\) = 0:) Tj
T*
(   an = 0 for all n >= 1.) Tj
T*
(   Step 5: Compute bn:) Tj
T*
(   bn = \(2 / T\) * int_0^T V'\(t\) * sin\(n*omega0*t\) dt) Tj
T*
(   = \(2*V0 / T\) * [ int_0^\(T/2\) sin\(n*omega0*t\) dt - int_{T/2}^T sin\(n*omega0*t\) dt ]) Tj
T*
(   = [ 2*V0 / \(n*pi\) ] * [ -cos\(n*pi\) - \(-cos 0\) - \(-cos 2n*pi - \(-cos n*pi\)\) ] / 2) Tj
T*
(   = [ 2*V0 / \(n*pi\) ] * [ 1 - \(-1\)^n ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 6: Values of bn:) Tj
T*
(   - For even n: bn = 0.) Tj
T*
(   - For odd n \(n = 2k - 1\): bn = 4*V0 / \(\(2k - 1\)*pi\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 7: Fourier Expansion:) Tj
T*
(   V'\(t\) = \(4*V0 / pi\) * sum_{k=1}^infinity [ sin\(\(2k - 1\)*2*pi*t / T\) / \(2k - 1\) ].) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   The respiratory airflow contains only odd sinusoidal harmonics, matching the square wave) Tj
T*
(   Fourier series.) Tj
