(>> Solution to Question 30:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: A periodic biological bioreactor stirrer oscillation velocity is given by v\(t\) = t^2 on \(-1, 1\) with period 2 \(L = 1\). Find its Fourier series, and use it to determine the fraction of total kinetic energy contained in the fundamental frequency harmonic.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Symmetry and Fourier Coefficients \(L = 1\):) Tj
T*
(   f\(t\) = t^2 is an EVEN function on [-1, 1].) Tj
T*
(   bn = 0 for all n >= 1.) Tj
T*
(   Step 2: Compute a0:) Tj
T*
(   a0 = \(2 / 1\) * int_0^1 t^2 dt = 2 * [ t^3 / 3 ]_0^1 = 2 / 3.) Tj
T*
(   Constant term: a0 / 2 = 1 / 3.) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Compute an:) Tj
T*
(   an = \(2 / 1\) * int_0^1 t^2 * cos\(n*pi*t\) dt.) Tj
T*
(   Integrate by parts:) Tj
T*
(   u = t^2, u' = 2t, u'' = 2.) Tj
T*
(   an = 2 * [ t^2 * \(sin n*pi*t / \(n*pi\)\) - 2t * \(-cos n*pi*t / \(n^2*pi^2\)\) + 2 * \(-sin n*pi*t /) Tj
T*
(   \(n^3*pi^3\)\) ]_0^1) Tj
T*
(   = 2 * [ 0 + 2\(1\)*cos\(n*pi\) / \(n^2*pi^2\) - 0 ]) Tj
T*
(   = 4 * \(-1\)^n / \(n^2 * pi^2\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Fourier Series Expansion:) Tj
T*
(   v\(t\) = 1/3 + \(4 / pi^2\) * sum_{n=1}^infinity [ \(-1\)^n / n^2 ] * cos\(n*pi*t\)) Tj
T*
(   = 1/3 - \(4 / pi^2\) * [ cos\(pi*t\)/1^2 - cos\(2*pi*t\)/2^2 + cos\(3*pi*t\)/3^2 - ... ].) Tj
T*
(   Step 5: Total Kinetic Energy \(Mean Square Velocity\):) Tj
T*
(   E_total = \(1 / 2L\) * int_{-1}^1 [v\(t\)]^2 dt = \(1 / 2\) * int_{-1}^1 t^4 dt) Tj
T*
(   = int_0^1 t^4 dt = [ t^5 / 5 ]_0^1 = 1 / 5 = 0.2000.) Tj
T*
(   Step 6: Energy in DC Component and Fundamental Harmonic \(n = 1\):) Tj
T*
(   - DC component power: P_DC = \(a0 / 2\)^2 = \(1/3\)^2 = 1/9 ~ 0.1111.) Tj
T*
(   - Fundamental AC harmonic \(n = 1\):) Tj
T*
(   a1 = -4 / pi^2 ~ -4 / 9.8696 = -0.4053.) Tj
T*
(   Power in fundamental harmonic = a1^2 / 2 = \(-0.4053\)^2 / 2 = 0.1643 / 2 = 0.0821.) Tj
T*
(   - Combined power in DC + Fundamental:) Tj
T*
(   P_DC + P1 = 0.1111 + 0.0821 = 0.1932.) Tj
T*
(   Step 7: Fraction of Kinetic Energy in Fundamental:) Tj
T*
(   - Fraction of total energy in fundamental AC harmonic:) Tj
T*
(   Fraction = P1 / E_total = 0.0821 / 0.2000 = 0.4107 = 41.07%.) Tj
T*
(   - Fraction of AC power in fundamental:) Tj
T*
(   P_AC_total = E_total - P_DC = 0.2000 - 0.1111 = 0.0889.) Tj
T*
(   Fraction of AC energy = 0.0821 / 0.0889 = 92.35%!) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   Over 92% of the alternating kinetic energy of the stirrer oscillation is concentrated in the) Tj
T*
(   fundamental frequency mode.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
